  "question": {
    "text": "Two particles <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are performing SHM along the same line about the same mean position. Initially, they are at their positive extreme position. If the time period of each particle is 12 s and the difference of their amplitudes is 12 cm then find the minimum time (in seconds) after which the separation between the particles become 6 cm."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The <math> <mtext>x</mtext> </math> coordinates of the particles are<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Separation <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Now <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac> <mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
  }
